        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect stamps. Deliver letters. Explore the world in a cozy collage adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Letter is a cozy incremental game about collecting unique stamps, delivering lost letters, and exploring cultures across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/79c7d63a74a6e32fd6fe6fe9c6891843.poster.avif?t=1763265757\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/79c7d63a74a6e32fd6fe6fe9c6891843.webm?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/79c7d63a74a6e32fd6fe6fe9c6891843.mp4?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >113 countries to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1300 unique stamps to collect (including rare, legendary, and booster)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade transports — from skateboards to airplanes — with a refreshed 3D-style HUD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimagined Challenge Mode with consulates, unique rewards, and golden stamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique collage- and scrapbooking-inspired art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, randomized targets for endless replayability</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lost, sad, and without purpose — until you find a letter that is also lost in the world.<br>You do not know who it belongs to, or where they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you know is: <strong>this letter must be delivered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from country to country, knocking on doors in search of the recipient. Along the way, collect hundreds of stamps inspired by the history, culture, and creativity of each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your transports, visit the Market to acquire boosters and rare items, and take on the redesigned Challenge Mode with cozy roguelike elements. Each new playthrough changes the recipient, ensuring infinite replayability in a relaxing and heartwarming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/477966c0efefce9849232c46a2df9b30.poster.avif?t=1763265757\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/477966c0efefce9849232c46a2df9b30.webm?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/477966c0efefce9849232c46a2df9b30.mp4?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect stamps. Deliver letters. Explore the world in a cozy collage adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Letter is a cozy incremental game about collecting unique stamps, delivering lost letters, and exploring cultures across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/79c7d63a74a6e32fd6fe6fe9c6891843.poster.avif?t=1763265757\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/79c7d63a74a6e32fd6fe6fe9c6891843.webm?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/79c7d63a74a6e32fd6fe6fe9c6891843.mp4?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >113 countries to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 1300 unique stamps to collect (including rare, legendary, and booster)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade transports — from skateboards to airplanes — with a refreshed 3D-style HUD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimagined Challenge Mode with consulates, unique rewards, and golden stamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique collage- and scrapbooking-inspired art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic, randomized targets for endless replayability</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lost, sad, and without purpose — until you find a letter that is also lost in the world.<br>You do not know who it belongs to, or where they are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you know is: <strong>this letter must be delivered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from country to country, knocking on doors in search of the recipient. Along the way, collect hundreds of stamps inspired by the history, culture, and creativity of each region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your transports, visit the Market to acquire boosters and rare items, and take on the redesigned Challenge Mode with cozy roguelike elements. Each new playthrough changes the recipient, ensuring infinite replayability in a relaxing and heartwarming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/477966c0efefce9849232c46a2df9b30.poster.avif?t=1763265757\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/477966c0efefce9849232c46a2df9b30.webm?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838740/extras/477966c0efefce9849232c46a2df9b30.mp4?t=1763265757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
